  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to assist Turkey implement a greenhouse gas Monitoring, Reporting, and Verification (MRV) pilot in the electricity sector, based on Turkey&amp;rsquo;s MRV regulation, and to provide analytical information for the establishment of a carbon market in Turkey.</narrative>
  </description>
